    "rich_text_zRKUXp": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "custom_css": [
        ".rte {text-align: left;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p><strong>From RTR (Ready To Run) RC products, to completely customisable RC Kits you can build from scratch!</strong><br/><br/>Here at <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com\" target=\"_blank\">HEARNS HOBBIES</a> we stock a large variety of <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.com/collections/radio-control\" target=\"_blank\">Radio Control</a> products, we have everything you would need for your next (or even your first!) venture into the RC Hobby!</p><p>We have been proudly supplying to the RC Hobby Community in Melbourne since 1947, we still haven't stopped! We are here for all your RC (Radio Control) needs!</p><p>With beginner safe RC selections such as <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/entry-level-rc\">Entry Level</a> selections, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/rc-rtr-cars-trucks\">RTR RC's (Ready To Run)</a> pre-built for your ease aside from the occasional extra battery, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/kyosho-mini-z\">Kyosho MiniZ</a> miniature RC's that make for the perfect little pocket rocket, and much more. For the seasoned RC Enthusiasts & Professional, there are high grade, heavily customisable <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/drift-cars-rtr\">Drift Cars</a> to get the perfect slide on those corners, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/race-on-road-kits\">On Road Kits</a> and <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/race-off-road-kits\">Off Road Kits</a> for those who specialise in either style of racing, along with other necessary additions such as a <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/radios-servos\">Radio Control</a> transmitter so you can steer your car (usually necessary if your kit doesn't come with one).</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
